// Supplementary scenario for the branch comparison video (not a regression test):
// fix 2 only.  The player steps into the Outpost bubble about 0.2 s before a
// zone tick while an abstract force fills the base meter, five times, and the
// per-frame UDFINE rows show whether that tick still drained the base.
// Generated by gen_scenario.py from supp.tmpl (@TRIAL expanded first).

triSimUntil { GM_LIB_READY }

GM_COMP_ALIVE = [false]
GM_QRF_TICK = 999999
{deleteVehicle _x} forEach ((units group player) - [player])
udT0 = time
triSimUntil { time > udT0 + 6 }
